## Install

Clone this repository into your personal skills folder:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/lightspeedwp/{{skillSlug}} ~/.claude/skills/{{skillSlug}}
```

Claude Code loads every skill in `~/.claude/skills/` when a new session starts. Keep only reviewed versions
there, and work on changes in a clone elsewhere.

## Usage

Ask Claude in your own words, or run `{{{quickStartCommand}}}`. [SKILL.md](SKILL.md) describes what the skill does
and when Claude uses it.

