## Development

```bash
npm install       # also installs the Git hooks
npm run lint:all
npm test
{{#hasBatsTests}}
npm run test:all  # Jest and BATS
{{/hasBatsTests}}
```

Branch names follow `{type}/{scope}-{title}`, for example `fix/skill-clarify-steps`. See [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md)
before changing the skill.

